Z||000000||MooCow||06-17-2001||06:11 PM||||Well on the drivers side door the key wont turn at all.  It goes in nice and all but won't turn so I can't unlock the door from the outside at all.  Any suggestions on how to fix this, or even replace it??  <BR>I tried using WD-40 to loosen it but it still wont turn.<P>                                Thanks Ken<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig.jpg"> <BR>87 GT, 3.4 engine with a 4:10 tranny, and Viper Yellow!||||reg||8
